{"detail": {"templateUuid": "bcaa2db2f8ae4f7b985b319c9787a13d", "projectUuid": "d8caa186c582458c91222fd9fc36b897", "name": "异常世界录 009 《伴生人》", "description": "《异常世界录》第009则。\n\n某天，一名工人吐出一团白丝。白丝落地后缠成小虫，不但会模仿人类，还会为了模仿，长出所需的身体。\n\n人们很快发现：只要一只学会，所有虫子都会掌握。它们由此进入工厂、医院与学校，逐渐接替人类的工作。\n\n多年后，虫子拥有了完整人形，还会根据每个人的喜好，变成他们心中最理想的模样。\n\n人们将它们称为“伴生人”。\n\n二十年后的一天，所有伴生人突然停止了动作。\n\n整座城市，安静了七分钟……", "coverUrl": "/assets/3f273b1087690053.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/aa32870b8efe4b21afd16bb00f08cdf3/e4bc73ba32b13125a6b2ac29b05851bd2ba9fb55.mov", "snapshotId": 45037, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 4832032, "ownerUuid": "aa32870b8efe4b21afd16bb00f08cdf3", "avatar": "/assets/5d8c03b8d5071104.webp", "nickname": "Flicker2045", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 56, "tags": [{"id": 1303, "code": "short_animation", "tagLabel": "动画短片", "parentTag": 1300, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1300/1303/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 3, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "userTags": [{"tagId": 5002, "name": "专业", "icon": "/assets/a31a6cc391430f72.webp", "primaryIcon": "/assets/7097b07d2df12cc8.webp", "desc": "LibTV专业作者", "verifyLevel": 2}], "score": 0, "socialMediaUrl": "36 【异常世界录-009《伴生人》 - Flicker2045 | 小红书 - 你的生活兴趣社区】 😆 39r2Z7xISHUozyl 😆 https://www.xiaohongshu.com/discovery/item/6aa230e0000000002802e377?source=webshare&xhsshare=pc_web&xsec_token=ABJh6gulz6i7fJJ2ltQSapWvdoufNwcHrNTHb99U74FUg=&xsec_source=pc_share", "createAt": "2026年09月10日 15:52", "updateAt": "2026年09月17日 20:00", "publishAt": "2026年09月10日 15:53", "playCount": 89, "viewCreationProcessCount": 39, "copyCanvasCount": 12, "shareCount": 1, "snapshotPath": "/data/canvas-snapshots/bcaa2db2f8ae4f7b985b319c9787a13d.json.gz", "snapshotSummary": {"nodes": 69, "edges": 55}}, "recommendList": []}